WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.158
The wound inside
my sealed memories

00:24.158 --> 00:28.796
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.796 --> 00:36.503
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.503 --> 00:41.308
I seek boundless strength

00:41.308 --> 00:52.119
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.119 --> 00:54.121
I want to protect

00:54.121 --> 00:56.490
I want to believe

00:56.490 --> 01:00.794
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.794 --> 01:05.165
The heat and the love

01:05.165 --> 01:09.403
I accept them all

01:09.403 --> 01:13.040
I won't let go of your hand again

01:13.040 --> 01:21.641
Aiming towards that light...

01:31.325 --> 01:34.590
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:39.700 --> 01:42.260
Are you feeling lonely?

01:43.303 --> 01:46.795
She used to be
my mother...

01:57.384 --> 01:59.375
- I'm counting on you!
- Yes!

02:00.254 --> 02:01.721
Lord Yukinari!

02:02.923 --> 02:06.188
There's been a sudden increase
in the crime rate.

02:07.161 --> 02:09.891
There've been reports of
holdups and robberies.

02:09.930 --> 02:12.728
I've got the top officers
patrolling the capital.

02:12.900 --> 02:14.197
Soul Binding.

02:17.037 --> 02:20.666
A man killing
bloodstained shikigami, Touda!

02:21.108 --> 02:23.804
I won't let you die easily...

02:28.549 --> 02:31.916
Severed Bond in the
Flames of Sin

02:34.154 --> 02:37.157
Mokkun! Rikugou!

02:37.157 --> 02:40.194
Taiin! Genbu!

02:40.194 --> 02:42.253
Mokkun!

02:47.501 --> 02:50.664
Mokkun! Mokkun!

02:55.175 --> 02:56.844
I've got to stay calm!

02:56.844 --> 03:00.473
I'll try to detect the presence
of shikigami...

03:04.318 --> 03:07.087
Seimei, Touda and the others
have disappeared!

03:07.087 --> 03:09.419
There's no aura of Taiin,
Genbu or Rikugou...

03:09.456 --> 03:12.292
I can't tell where they are.

03:12.292 --> 03:14.495
Yes, I know.

03:14.495 --> 03:17.555
It seems like they've been
sucked into the portal.

03:18.532 --> 03:20.727
We should go look
for them.

03:26.373 --> 03:29.610
A malignant curse hails from
the eastern skies...

03:29.610 --> 03:34.445
I deflect it with the strength of
souls who reside in heaven...

03:34.982 --> 03:38.085
And overcome the disasters
yet to befall us.

03:38.085 --> 03:41.188
A malignant curse hails from
the southern skies...

03:41.188 --> 03:45.726
I deflect it with the strength of
souls who reside in heaven.

03:45.726 --> 03:48.428
A malignant curse hails from
the western skies...

03:48.428 --> 03:52.166
I deflect it with the strength of
80 thousands...

03:52.166 --> 03:52.332
the souls who reside in heaven.
I deflect it with the strength of
80 thousands...

03:52.332 --> 03:55.369
the souls who reside in heaven.
Atsuyasu... Nagako...

03:55.369 --> 03:56.563
Atsuyasu... Nagako...

03:59.706 --> 04:02.075
Hang in there,
Miss Akiko.

04:02.075 --> 04:08.605
The onmyouji will exorcise
the evil spirits very soon.

04:08.982 --> 04:10.210
Okay.

04:11.485 --> 04:13.248
Taiin! Genbu!

04:13.453 --> 04:14.688
Rikugou!

04:14.688 --> 04:15.985
Masahiro!

04:16.089 --> 04:18.225
Hey, where have you been?

04:18.225 --> 04:22.429
- Don't make us worry!
- Well...

04:22.429 --> 04:24.698
That's my line.

04:24.698 --> 04:26.300
Where's Mokkun?

04:26.300 --> 04:28.635
I haven't seen him at all.

04:28.635 --> 04:30.103
I see.

04:30.103 --> 04:33.473
I'm sure he can take care
of himself.

04:33.473 --> 04:35.375
That's right.

04:35.375 --> 04:37.411
How did you guys find
your way here?

04:37.411 --> 04:39.880
We were detecting the presence
of humans.

04:39.880 --> 04:42.713
And naturally we were led
to that...

04:46.720 --> 04:48.855
That's Princess Nagako.

04:48.855 --> 04:52.259
So she's the one
who created this portal.

04:52.259 --> 04:55.262
What should we do?
Take her back by force?

04:55.262 --> 04:58.999
But, the portal and Princess
Nagako's heart are connected.

04:58.999 --> 05:03.237
If we make one false move,
it might increase in size.

05:03.237 --> 05:05.603
Let me try talking
to her.

05:11.645 --> 05:13.909
Princess Nagako.

05:15.649 --> 05:17.384
You're the princess, right?

05:17.384 --> 05:20.787
I was looking for you.
Let's go home.

05:20.787 --> 05:22.522
Go home?

05:22.522 --> 05:25.792
Mikado and the empress are
very worried about you.

05:25.792 --> 05:29.626
- So let's get you home...
- Don't lie!

05:29.763 --> 05:33.233
My mother thinks that Atsuyasu
is cuter that me.

05:33.233 --> 05:35.902
She doesn't like me at all.

05:35.902 --> 05:38.505
And now that Kazane's gone...

05:38.505 --> 05:42.373
Everyone... hates me!

05:43.677 --> 05:45.045
Listen to me...

05:45.045 --> 05:47.781
There are no parents who
don't love their children.

05:47.781 --> 05:51.351
Liar! I was always alone!

05:51.351 --> 05:55.188
Mother was always with Atsuyasu,
and so were the maids!

05:55.188 --> 06:00.994
My grandfather said that the
empress cared for both of you.

06:00.994 --> 06:03.630
- And that's the truth.
- You're lying!

06:03.630 --> 06:05.359
You're lying!

06:07.668 --> 06:09.102
Genbu!

06:09.102 --> 06:10.470
What is it?

06:10.470 --> 06:15.203
Your water mirror can show
distant objects, right?

06:15.309 --> 06:17.937
Can you show us the palace?

06:18.478 --> 06:21.748
I should be able to show
you the First Palace but...

06:21.748 --> 06:25.252
I'm not sure if my power can
reach there in this miasma.

06:25.252 --> 06:26.753
Please.

06:26.753 --> 06:30.086
I want her to see...

06:30.223 --> 06:32.885
...the empress's feeling.

06:33.860 --> 06:35.259
I'll try.

06:43.003 --> 06:44.766
Nagako...

06:47.741 --> 06:50.210
Mother?

06:50.210 --> 06:54.374
Nagako...
Nagako, are you all right?

06:54.548 --> 07:00.612
After Atsuyasu was born,
I didn't spend much time on her.

07:00.987 --> 07:07.594
If she's suffering alone,
what should I?

07:07.594 --> 07:10.964
Hurry, bring back Atsuyasu
and Nagako!

07:10.964 --> 07:13.558
I want my precious children...

07:13.900 --> 07:16.266
in my arms!

07:20.574 --> 07:21.808
Genbu!

07:21.808 --> 07:24.678
I'm sorry...
I tried my best.

07:24.678 --> 07:28.011
Sorry for making you do that.

07:28.382 --> 07:30.748
Mother...

07:35.589 --> 07:39.753
Will it be a little brother,
or a little sister?

07:39.893 --> 07:42.327
I wonder...
what will it be?

07:42.362 --> 07:45.098
Whether it's a little boy
or a little girl,

07:45.098 --> 07:48.068
it'll be as precious to me
as you are.

07:48.068 --> 07:51.003
As precious... as I am?

07:51.571 --> 07:55.409
Yes, just like this
upcoming child,

07:55.409 --> 08:00.540
you are irreplaceable and
so precious to me.

08:09.256 --> 08:13.215
Mother... Mother!

08:15.028 --> 08:19.089
Mother... Mother!

08:19.266 --> 08:24.033
I want to see my mother!
I miss her, I miss her!

08:24.905 --> 08:29.467
Okay, let's hurry home
to see your mother.

08:30.243 --> 08:34.009
I'll go home to Mother!

08:48.361 --> 08:52.127
Is that a monster muted by the
miasma from the underworld?

08:52.232 --> 08:55.827
Looks like we won't be
heading back so quickly!

08:57.971 --> 09:00.166
Take this!

09:08.281 --> 09:11.250
What? That's not fair!

09:14.087 --> 09:15.748
Wave Shield!

09:17.958 --> 09:22.095
Is he using the miasma to
heal his wounds?

09:22.095 --> 09:24.393
That's not good.

09:25.232 --> 09:28.759
Where are you when we
need you most... Mokkun?

09:30.604 --> 09:33.874
- Come on, let's move!
- Take everything!

09:33.874 --> 09:36.009
Hold it right there!

09:36.009 --> 09:39.877
What do you want?
Let go of me!

09:40.046 --> 09:43.416
Some are escaping from the back!
Don't let them get away!

09:43.416 --> 09:44.747
Yes, Sir!

09:44.918 --> 09:48.046
- Let go!
- Let me go!

09:48.989 --> 09:52.925
This rage...
What exactly is going on?

10:00.333 --> 10:02.235
Are you all right?

10:02.235 --> 10:05.105
We've put up a
purifying barrier in there.

10:05.105 --> 10:07.374
Why don't you rest inside
for a while?

10:07.374 --> 10:10.866
Oh, yes.
Thank you.

10:16.650 --> 10:19.881
Why don't you get
defeated already!

10:24.057 --> 10:25.217
Taiin!

10:34.768 --> 10:36.702
We can't go on
like this...

10:39.806 --> 10:41.137
Genbu!

10:41.374 --> 10:43.274
Take care of
Princess Nagako!

10:44.878 --> 10:46.539
Masahiro!

10:46.713 --> 10:50.517
I beseech you deities.
Save your servants from the evil!

10:50.517 --> 10:53.680
Bind the monster and
suppress the evil!

10:55.755 --> 10:58.451
100 monsters, be gone!

11:09.502 --> 11:11.493
Why you!

11:20.547 --> 11:22.344
Masahiro!

11:38.598 --> 11:40.065
Guren...

11:43.203 --> 11:44.568
Guren!

11:50.577 --> 11:54.147
Thank goodness!
You're okay.

11:54.147 --> 11:56.449
I was worried about you!

11:56.449 --> 12:00.010
Now we've got to find a way
to get out of here.

12:03.923 --> 12:07.154
Guren, where's your
sealing gold crown?

12:16.603 --> 12:18.969
Gu... ren...

12:24.544 --> 12:26.413
Gu...

12:26.413 --> 12:28.210
ren...

12:52.138 --> 12:53.537
Masahiro.

12:53.707 --> 12:57.837
What's the matter, Miss Akiko?
Are you in pain?

12:57.944 --> 13:02.074
No... it's nothing.

13:11.391 --> 13:16.162
Humans are fragile. It's boring
that they're not challenging.

13:16.162 --> 13:20.758
Why? Why... Touda?

13:25.004 --> 13:27.234
Go, wind!

13:30.777 --> 13:32.870
Masahiro!

13:37.484 --> 13:39.252
This is terrible!

13:39.252 --> 13:41.187
Genbu, can you stop
the bleeding?

13:41.187 --> 13:43.389
Right away!

13:43.389 --> 13:45.448
Hope it's not too late.

13:48.394 --> 13:52.699
Masahiro, quit messing around!
Open your eyes!

13:52.699 --> 13:54.496
Stop wasting time!

13:55.568 --> 13:57.934
The boy will die.

14:00.440 --> 14:01.873
Kazane!

14:01.908 --> 14:06.246
Killed by Touda,
his most trusted companion.

14:06.246 --> 14:07.747
Isn't that ironic?

14:07.747 --> 14:11.877
It's you! What did you do
to Touda?!

14:11.985 --> 14:16.354
I used myself as a decoy
to lure him here!

14:16.523 --> 14:18.423
Look at him.

14:28.301 --> 14:31.702
Touda...
How could you...

14:43.383 --> 14:47.887
That's the monster...
of the land of the dead.

14:47.887 --> 14:50.523
Nobody can stop him now.

14:50.523 --> 14:54.015
Kazane!
Kazane, are you all right?

14:54.828 --> 14:57.263
The monster of the
land of the dead?

14:57.263 --> 14:58.958
That's right.

14:58.998 --> 15:03.799
Touda was possessed by the
Soul Binding spell that I cast.

15:03.837 --> 15:08.208
So did you lure him out here
with your power...

15:08.208 --> 15:12.201
in order to make Touda guilty
by killing Masahiro?

15:13.379 --> 15:16.182
Why?! Why did you do this
to Touda?

15:16.182 --> 15:21.017
Isn't it obvious?
My father was killed by Touda!

15:26.826 --> 15:28.561
Suffer more!

15:28.561 --> 15:30.028
Kazane!

15:30.697 --> 15:33.032
I'm... sorry.

15:33.032 --> 15:37.469
I never meant for you
to see all this.

15:39.272 --> 15:42.673
I know you were just lonely too...

15:52.952 --> 15:55.648
...just like me before.

15:55.722 --> 16:00.159
That's why...
I'm going to take you...

16:02.729 --> 16:07.564
back home to...
where your mother is.

16:07.634 --> 16:10.803
Kazane, what's the matter?
Are you hurt?

16:10.803 --> 16:12.430
Kazane!

16:29.956 --> 16:31.821
Rikugou!

16:32.392 --> 16:34.019
But why?

16:37.530 --> 16:39.964
- Lord Yukinari!
- Toshitsugu!

16:40.033 --> 16:42.869
How are Mikado and the empress?

16:42.869 --> 16:47.135
Lord Yoshimasa and the others
are still praying...

16:47.206 --> 16:49.709
But nothing seems
to be working.

16:49.709 --> 16:51.077
I see.

16:51.077 --> 16:54.308
There's a lot of commotion
going on in the capital.

16:55.081 --> 16:57.383
I think it's the effect
of the miasma.

16:57.383 --> 16:59.252
I really need your help.

16:59.252 --> 17:01.955
Yes, we'll do our best!

17:01.955 --> 17:03.456
Lord Yukinari!

17:03.456 --> 17:07.327
It's reported that the robbers
are looting the 5th street!

17:07.327 --> 17:08.928
I'll be right there!

17:08.928 --> 17:11.464
Toshitsugu,
I'm counting on you!

17:11.464 --> 17:14.092
Lord Yukinari, be careful!

17:19.872 --> 17:21.507
This spiritual aura...

17:21.507 --> 17:25.705
So it was you who
saved me back then.

17:25.778 --> 17:28.713
Sever your ties with
Chishiki no Guuji!

17:29.082 --> 17:32.785
He preys on the weaknesses
of others for his own gains.

17:32.785 --> 17:35.253
You've been cheated!

17:38.925 --> 17:40.552
Let me go!

17:40.860 --> 17:44.664
It's not too late to
turn back now.

17:44.664 --> 17:46.655
Let me go!

17:47.233 --> 17:48.564
Kazane!

17:49.302 --> 17:51.702
This is what I want.

17:51.838 --> 17:55.108
I took revenge on
my own will!

17:55.108 --> 17:59.512
Because I am
the daughter of...

17:59.512 --> 18:04.108
Enoki Ryusai that Touda killed!

18:15.028 --> 18:16.825
Wind Slice the Evil Demon!

18:28.207 --> 18:30.198
It's you.

18:36.215 --> 18:39.651
- Suzaku, Tenitsu!
- Right away!

18:43.256 --> 18:45.925
It's the same no matter
how many of you show up.

18:45.925 --> 18:47.527
Guren...

18:47.527 --> 18:51.588
You've committed the sin again...

18:52.799 --> 18:57.403
I've stopped the bleeding,
but there's internal damage too.

18:57.403 --> 19:00.139
Please, Tenitsu. Hurry!

19:00.139 --> 19:02.198
I understand.

19:02.375 --> 19:06.512
I'll use my powers to transfer
the injuries to myself.

19:06.512 --> 19:08.104
Tenitsu!

19:09.982 --> 19:13.145
I'm his only hope.

19:18.424 --> 19:20.593
This body is not mine.

19:20.593 --> 19:23.796
I embrace your pain and
accept your misfortune...

19:23.796 --> 19:25.627
Come and be healed.

19:46.018 --> 19:48.145
Shatter!

19:59.999 --> 20:01.367
Are you all right?

20:01.367 --> 20:06.395
That's the Touda,
the shikigami of infernal fire.

20:06.439 --> 20:09.499
Beating him isn't going
to be easy.

20:10.576 --> 20:12.703
How is it, Seimei?

20:13.146 --> 20:16.582
Your shikigami is my
puppet now.

20:16.582 --> 20:18.050
Ryusai?

20:18.050 --> 20:20.720
Long time no see, old friend.

20:20.720 --> 20:22.745
Exterminate!

20:22.855 --> 20:26.859
Hey, is that how you greet
an old friend?

20:26.859 --> 20:30.496
Ryusai is no longer alive!
He died many years ago!

20:30.496 --> 20:33.260
He fell into your trap!

20:34.901 --> 20:37.937
I won't forget
that aura of evil.

20:37.937 --> 20:40.405
You are Chishiki no Guuji!

20:40.706 --> 20:44.904
The one who tricked Ryusai
and cursed Mikado!

20:48.347 --> 20:51.017
You're as sharp as ever,
Abe no Seimei.

20:51.017 --> 20:54.020
You don't get mesmerized
so easily.

20:54.020 --> 20:57.156
Your shikigami, Touda,
already belongs to me.

20:57.156 --> 21:00.593
If I offer this god servant
as a sacrifice...

21:00.593 --> 21:03.892
the seal to the underworld
will be broken.

21:04.163 --> 21:10.796
This time I'll break the seals and
open the gates of the underworld.

21:12.071 --> 21:15.975
Now, the monster of
the netherworld...

21:15.975 --> 21:19.672
burn and destroy them
with your flames!

21:42.902 --> 21:54.380
Everyone, as time passes,
loses sight of his dreams

21:54.380 --> 22:05.691
Errors and pains are repeated
through the ages

22:05.691 --> 22:11.430
Why do we resist believing
in each other?

22:11.430 --> 22:17.027
Why do we put out
the light of fate?

22:19.238 --> 22:29.548
I want to protect our future
with this hand

22:29.548 --> 22:36.355
Because you taught me

22:36.355 --> 22:41.594
What it means to challenge
with all my strength

22:41.594 --> 22:47.400
You will keep overcoming
your limits

22:47.400 --> 22:55.034
Surely surely surely

22:59.745 --> 23:02.646
Next Episode

23:23.436 --> 23:25.204
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.204 --> 23:26.806
Episode 22.

23:26.806 --> 23:29.240
Episode 22
All for the Sake of the
Honored Miko
All for the Sake of the
Honored Miko
